{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1226946-m-taw-path-and-order-spotify-playlists","id":1226946,"title":"M:tAw Path and Order Spotify Playlists","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-12T14:58:56-07:00","id":1226946,"title":"M:tAw Path and Order Spotify Playlists","content":"<div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I've been surfing Spotify for playlists about a specific path or order, and there don't seem to be any more precise than a playlist of all orders, so I came here in hopes of having help building some for games.</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Example format;</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u200bObrimos: Gabriel's Message (The Sixteen)</span></span></span></div> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252c2f\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">\u200bGo nuts, come up with some accurate ones, and I'll figure out how to post playlists here for you guys to use.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Edit: A list of playlists are on page 1, post #9.</span></span></span></div></div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/13.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":4793,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","user":"HunterInTheNight","date":". 06-22-2018, 12:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4793-hunterinthenight","name":"HunterInTheNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"168"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-12T17:34:14-07:00","id":1226979,"title":"","content":"This is a wikidot page about the paths, its on a campaign called King of The Hill, each path's specific page has has a theme music:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://kingofthehill.wikidot.com/paths\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://d3g0gp89917ko0.cloudfront.net/v--291054f06006/common--images/social/twitter.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://kingofthehill.wikidot.com/paths\" target=\"_blank\"> Pathways to Enlightenment - King of the Hill </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://kingofthehill.wikidot.com/paths\" target=\"_blank\"> http://kingofthehill.wikidot.com/paths </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I only saw the one for the Acathus, which is Float On by Modest Mouse, it felt very appropriate, so it might be worth a look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 06-12-2018, 08:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-12T20:30:39-07:00","id":1227031,"title":"","content":"Some of my choices here were inspired by King of the Hill, DaveB's suggestions and elsewhere, but I've still got a lot of stuff for you. Mage is my most 'complete' playlist, though I remain unsure of a fair number of my choices. I've been looking for something for the Tremere for a long time.<br /> <br /> -<br /> Acanthus: Definition of Destiny (Billy Talent)<br /> Mastigos: Into the Mind (Miracle of Sound)<br /> Moros: Magic and Loss (Lou Reed)<br /> Obrimos: Horizon (Jaxson Gamble)<br /> Thyrsus: Mother Earth (Miracle of Sound)<br /> -<br /> <br /> -<br /> The Pentacle: The Humbling River (Puscifer)<br /> <br /> Adamantine Arrow: This is War (Thirty Seconds to Mars), Guren No Yumiya (Jonathan Young)<br /> Guardians of the Veil: Beautiful Crime (Tamer)<br /> Mysterium: Chant of the Awakening (Arcana), Alethia (Jillian Aversa)<br /> Silver Ladder: Tiamat (The Pentagram), For Tomorrow (Shaman), My Body is a Cage (Peter Gabriel)<br /> <br /> Free Council: My Name is Human (Highly Suspect), Uprising (Muse)<br /> -<br /> <br /> -<br /> Seers of the Throne: Everybody Wants To Rule The World (Lorde), Apocalypse (Jasper Kyd), The Weaver (Puscifer)<br /> <br /> The Unity and the Hegemonic Ministry: Why We Build the Wall (<span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Ana\u00efs Mitchell) - I'm looking for more songs about nationalism for the Hegemons, but most are too specific to a particular nation for use elsewhere.</span></span></span><br /> The General and the Praetorian Ministry: Counting Bodies Like Sheep to the Rhythm of the War Drums (A Perfect Circle), Dogs of War (Pink Floyd)<br /> The Father and the Ministry of Paternoster: Into the Nothing (Miracle of Sound)<br /> The Eye and the Ministry of Panopticon: Electric Eye (Judas Priest)<br /> The Chancellor and the Ministry of Mammon: Welcome to the Machine (Pink Floyd)<br /> <br /> The Raptor: Do the Evolution (Pearl Jam)<br /> The Nemesis: Darkness, Darkness (The Youngbloods - April Gibson Cover)<br /> -<br /> <br /> -<br /> The Left-Handed: Arsonist's Lullaby (Hozier)<br /> The Mad: Eyes Open (Wolfmother)<br /> Scelesti: Anti-Pattern (After the Burial) - It's not my usual style, but it fits the Scelesti well.<br /> Alternate Scelesti: Mirrors (Havayoth) - Because Goofy is definitely a Scelestus.<br /> -","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":203,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","user":"Kleptomania","date":". 06-12-2018, 11:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-12T22:28:15-07:00","id":1227050,"t